{
 "brief": "The World Health Organization director-general Tedros Adhanom Ghebreyesus condemned attacks targeting health facilities and medical and humanitarian workers in Gaza, calling for their protection and an end to such strikes. The statement followed the killing of two Doctors Without Borders staff members in an attack on a clinic in Gaza City, Shehab Wire reported.\n\nTedros demanded that health workers and facilities be shielded from violence, emphasizing their essential role in providing care amid the ongoing conflict.",
